    "command": "bun $TMPDIR/f2.ts  (Buffer.concat of '{\"seq\":0,\"events\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"' + 0xff + '\"}]}', then .toString('utf8') and JSON.parse, the same as readJson; then TextDecoder fatal on the same bytes)",
